*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : CRD0048
*> PURPOSE : CREDIT APPROVAL RULES
*> AUTHOR  : J.K.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1989-03-19 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   1998-12-02 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 287
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB CRDNIGHT STEP040
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CRD0048.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-IN-REC.
    COPY CRD0048C.
01 OUT-RECORD.
    *> ASSIGNED CREDIT LIMIT
    05 APPROVED-LIMIT     PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT WS-IN-REC
    PERFORM SET-CARD-LIMIT
    DISPLAY "APPROVED-LIMIT=" APPROVED-LIMIT
    STOP RUN.
SET-CARD-LIMIT.
    EVALUATE TRUE
        *> PRIME CREDIT LIMIT
        WHEN BUREAU-SCORE NOT LESS THAN 740
            COMPUTE APPROVED-LIMIT = ANNUAL-INCOME * 0.25
        *> STANDARD CREDIT LIMIT
        WHEN BUREAU-SCORE >= 680
            COMPUTE APPROVED-LIMIT = ANNUAL-INCOME * 0.20
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE 1000 TO APPROVED-LIMIT
    END-EVALUATE.
